# A flag put on a road with the Flag button splits the road into two roads that meet at it; a carrier works each half.
# Run it on the game view with seed 1234567812345678 and size 1:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh road-split --game-view --seed 1234567812345678 --size 1 --fps 10
# On that map the castle stands at 21,4, so its flag is at 22,5. The woodcutter goes to 26,4, its flag to 27,5, and the road
# between the flags runs five steps east; the flag goes on 25,5, two steps from the woodcutter's flag (24,5 holds a tree).
expect seed = 1234567812345678
expect size = 1
wait 0.3
click-tile 21 4
wait 0.3
button Woodcutter
click-tile 26 4
button Woodcutter
wait 0.3
button Road
click-tile 22 5
click-tile 23 5
click-tile 24 5
click-tile 25 5
click-tile 26 5
click-tile 27 5
button Road
wait 0.3
fast-forward carrier state 0x42 max 20000
wait 0.3
shot one-road 24 5 3 3
list one-road

button Flag
click-tile 25 5
button Flag
wait 0.3
name flag 25 5 flag
expect-event flag place-flag cause placed
expect-event flag split-roads cause placed
shot split 24 5 3 3
list split
fast-forward until count waits-at-flag = 2 max 1000
wait 0.3
expect-count carrier = 2
expect-at 24 5 carrier
expect-at 26 5 carrier
shot two-carriers 24 5 3 3
list two-carriers
dump after
